{"3714560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fool's Cup", "steam_appid": 3714560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Fool’s Cup?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Kingdom of the Kingdom of Heart Boxers., only one title matters.<br> The Greatest Jester of the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fool’s Cup</strong> is an online multiplayer PVP party game set in a colorful medieval world, where jesters <strong>slap, shove, strike, and knock each other out</strong> in a chaotic tournament for the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will <strong>slap, push, throw, and outplay other players</strong> to force them out of the arena or leave them stunned and defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes alliances form. <br>Sometimes it’s every jester for themselves. <br><strong>But every round ends the same way: only one jester remains standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer PVP combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap-based physical attacks, brawling, and player elimination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful medieval arenas filled with chaotic mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or fight everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable matches packed with fun and rivalry<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about honor or glory. <br>It’s about <strong>combat-driven chaos, dirty tricks, and slapping your friends out of the arena at the perfect moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win by eliminating your rivals.</strong><br><strong>Claim the crown.</strong><br><strong>Become the kingdom’s greatest fool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Fool’s Cup?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Kingdom of the Kingdom of Heart Boxers., only one title matters.<br> The Greatest Jester of the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fool’s Cup</strong> is an online multiplayer PVP party game set in a colorful medieval world, where jesters <strong>slap, shove, strike, and knock each other out</strong> in a chaotic tournament for the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will <strong>slap, push, throw, and outplay other players</strong> to force them out of the arena or leave them stunned and defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes alliances form. <br>Sometimes it’s every jester for themselves. <br><strong>But every round ends the same way: only one jester remains standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer PVP combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap-based physical attacks, brawling, and player elimination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful medieval arenas filled with chaotic mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or fight everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable matches packed with fun and rivalry<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about honor or glory. <br>It’s about <strong>combat-driven chaos, dirty tricks, and slapping your friends out of the arena at the perfect moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win by eliminating your rivals.</strong><br><strong>Claim the crown.</strong><br><strong>Become the kingdom’s greatest fool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.poster.avif?t=1786370483\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.webm?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.mp4?t=1786370483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The jesters enter the arena in the Kingdom of Heart Boxers. Fight your rivals in chaotic PvP mini-games. Punch, shove, and throw them off the arena. Be the last jester standing and claim the title of the Kingdom’s Greatest Jester.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/eae790785f8b8c471ed824d42e80b4e391520f1e/header.jpg?t=1786370483", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/c8a546fbfd4ce3f14be1fed10ffd3b543903aad7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786370483", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/c8a546fbfd4ce3f14be1fed10ffd3b543903aad7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786370483", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit only <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<br>